{"id":"dema_s","lemma":"demás","pos":"pron","rank":458,"glosses":["others, other ones"],"ipa":"/deˈmas/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-dem%C3%A1s.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Dónde estaban los demás?","en":"Where were the others?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Los demás me están esperando.","en":"The others are waiting for me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/422442","words":[{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to hope","l":"esperar"}]},{"text":"Todos los demás niños lo hacen.","en":"All the other kids do it.","words":[{"g":"all","l":"todo"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"child, boy","l":"niño"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]},{"text":"Nunca hables mal de los demás.","en":"Never speak ill of others.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590264","words":[{"g":"never"},{"g":"to talk","l":"hablar"},{"g":"badly, poorly, ill"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"Pon ese libro sobre los demás.","en":"Put this book on top of the others.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704744","words":[{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"book"},{"g":"envelope"},{"g":"the / them"},null]}]}